	(text "AMP RIGHT - TAS5805M (U401), BTL, ch A = woofer, ch B = tweeter"
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
				(thickness 0.6)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f8479dc6-1e53-4d3c-9244-c702c1999764")
	)
	(text "Design notes"
		(at 20.32 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89a9a781-7051-46c9-9368-74e865082201")
	)
	(text "I2C address 0x2D (7-bit): R401 = 15k ADR/FAULT strap to DVDD (+3V3). amp_left: R301 = 4.7k -> 0x2C. Pin 3 is also FAULTZ -> AMPR_FAULT_N (merged on mcu sheet)."
		(at 20.32 238.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "abb0905f-0964-413f-8628-3173cf0e8dc3")
	)
	(text "PVDD = 18.0 V (boost, power sheet); DVDD = +3V3. AVDD (5 V) and VR_DIG (1.5 V) are internal regulator outputs: cap only, no other load."
		(at 20.32 242.57 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "99fd125e-d9d3-4df6-a21a-b0ea791501e9")
	)
	(text "Output LC per leg: 10 uH (FXL0630-100-M, Isat 5.5 A) + 1 uF 50 V X7R to GND -> BTL f0 ~ 50 kHz. Fsw = 768 kHz (FSW_SEL = 000), Hybrid modulation."
		(at 20.32 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aad83298-a257-48ad-a7bb-5261336c25df")
	)
	(text "Ch A = woofer J401, 8 ohm (ND65-8): DRC/AGL at max 15.5 V pk. Ch B = tweeter J402, 4 ohm (OT19NC00-04): limiter max 8 V pk after crossover is MANDATORY (OCP 5 A)."
		(at 20.32 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f4d6eabd-26ee-4ad1-8b05-0818c3038db9")
	)
	(text "Layout: C404 + C402/C403 at pins 15/16, C407 + C405/C406 at pins 27/28 (100 nF within 1 mm), C401 between groups. Bootstrap C412-C415 straight BST to OUT, top layer, no vias."
		(at 20.32 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f2b33279-6c6f-4579-bb7d-50dc8ab5b26b")
	)
	(text "Speaker terminals are BTL and float at ~PVDD/2: never tie either terminal to GND. SDOUT (pin 9) not used."
		(at 20.32 257.81 0)
